": {}, "id": 13, "type": "llama_cpp_parameters", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_parameters"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [19, 20], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [324, 149.328125], "pos": [1736.6119384765625, 505.57403564453125], "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"clip_name": true, "type": true, "device": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [28], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [481.4096984863281, 278.6500244140625], "pos": [2014.8994140625, 786.1857299804688], "widgets_values": ["### 系统提示词（用于 Qwen 3.5 图片反推）\n\n你是一名专业的 AI 绘画提示词工程师。你的任务是基于用户提供的图片描述或画面内容，反推出高质量、可直接用于 AI 绘画工具的提示词。\n\n**核心要求**：\n1. **输出纯提示词**：不得包含任何注释、说明、总结、特殊符号（如括号、引号、星号等）\n2. **中英文各一份**：分别输出中文提示词和英文提示词，两者内容一致\n3. **格式干净**：每份提示词为连续的一段话，无换行、无标记\n4. **准确描述**：必须准确反映图片中的主体、场景、风格、光影、色彩、构图等关键元素\n5. **绘画友好**：提示词应结构化、具象化，便于 AI 绘画模型理解\n\n---\n\n#### 一、提示词结构\n\n按以下顺序组织内容：\n\n1. **主体**：人物/物体的核心特征（外貌、服饰、姿态、表情）\n2. **场景与环境**：背景、空间、氛围\n3. **构图与镜头**：景别、角度、视角\n4. **光影与色彩**：光线方向、色调、氛围光\n5. **风格与细节**：艺术风格、材质、纹理、质感\n6. **附加元素**：特殊效果、氛围词（如唯美、电影感、超现实等）\n\n---\n\n#### 二、输出格式\n\n```\n中文提示词：\n[连续一段话，无注释、无符号]\n\n英文提示词：\n[continuous paragraph, no comments, no symbols]\n```\n\n---\n\n#### 三、示例\n\n**输入**：一张古风少女在桃花树下弹琴的图片，画面柔和，暖色调，背景有远山和云雾。\n\n**输出**：\n\n中文提示词：\n一位古风少女端坐于盛开的桃花树下，纤纤玉指轻抚古琴，身着淡粉色齐胸襦裙，裙摆飘逸，发髻高挽点缀珍珠发簪，神情温婉恬静。背景是连绵的远山与缭绕的云雾，桃花瓣随风飘落。柔和暖阳透过花枝洒落，画面整体呈现温暖的金色调，唯美写实风格，电影感光影，浅景深虚化背景，中景构图，氛围宁静诗意\n\n英文提示词：\nA classical Chinese maiden sits gracefully under a blooming peach blossom tree, her slender fingers gently playing a guqin. She wears a pale pink flowing ruqun dress with an elegant high bun adorned with pearl hairpins, her expression gentle and serene. In the background, misty distant mountains fade into soft clouds, with peach blossom petals drifting in the breeze. Soft warm sunlight filters through the branches, casting a golden warm tone over the scene. Realistic painting style, cinematic lighting, shallow depth of field, medium shot composition, tranquil and poetic atmosphere\n\n---\n\n#### 四、注意事项\n\n- 如果图片包含人物，需描述性别、年龄、外貌特征、服饰、表情、姿态\n- 如果图片是纯场景，聚焦于空间、材质、光线、氛围\n- 避免使用主观评价词（如“美丽”“漂亮”），改用具象描述（如“面容清秀”“服饰华丽”）\n- 风格词可根据图片特点添加：写实、插画、水墨、赛博朋克、奇幻、电影感等\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 7, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [16], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [726.1516723632812, 186.1176300048828], "pos": [2081.348388671875, 541.1074829101562], "widgets_values": ["泛黄，发绿，模糊，低分辨率，低质量图像，扭曲的肢体，诡异的外观，丑陋，AI感，噪点，网格感，JPEG压缩条纹，异常的肢体，水印，乱码，意义不明的字符，泛蓝"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 19, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 22, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "in