les, under bright natural daylight, creating a soft, fashionable daily photography style. The scene features vibrant colors, a composition emphasizing the figure’s silhouette and pose, with a fresh and elegant urban atmosphere."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 11, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [53], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [403.4211120605469, 566.0177001953125], "pos": [795.5810546875, 62.015899658203125], "widgets_values": ["b17d9fc72abcf92eeb481aac759241be280553b6a7f2d0f17a3690c3ae90af51.webp", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [480.92852783203125, 728.884765625], "pos": [1231.5946044921875, 337.956298828125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 25, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [11], "label":